Getting SX going quickly:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
1)	Install it!

2)	Check conferences and filepaths for each. The config comes with
	these, so change them to your likeing:

	1. New Users
	2. Empty
	3. H/P/A			files:hack/
	4. XXX Pics			files:xxx/
	5. Net TOolz			files:net/
	6. SX Support			files:bbs/
	7. Amiga Warez			files:pi/
	8. Requests			files:req/

	(these paths should be used to store files on hdd)

	To change these paths run SX-Config and click on the "Conf/Msg/File"
	button. You might want to edit SX:Confs/<conf>/paths also.

3)	Load SX-Config and click on "This Node", and change the
	"FileCheckDir". This should be a empty directory for the BBS
	to do some work in, you must create it!

4)	run SX:SX-MCP

5)	run a node! eg: "run sx:sx 1" will load node 1
